{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4L5J6em9Zvw6UUFn8c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism clicks. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, echoing through stone corridors.*\n\n*A seam of light appears — thin as a blade — widening.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n───────────────────────\n│                                          │\n│                                          │\n│         You may pass.                │\n│                                          │\n│                                          │\n───────────────────────\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor stretching into warm amber light, the scent of old wood and distant rain. The air moves through me like a first breath.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":141,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}